# Defense in depth for credentials accidentally placed under an allowed tree.
**/*.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env.*
**/*credentials*
**/*credential*
**/*secrets*
**/*secret*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.ssh
**/.aws
**/.docker
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
